{command} [check|pull|restart|status]
Update the bot straight from its git repo, from chat.
*/ check   - see if there are new commits on the remote (default with no args)
*/ pull    - pull the latest update (auto-cancelled if you have uncommitted local changes)
*/ status  - quick git status (git status --short --branch)
*/ restart - restart the bot so a pulled update takes effect
Needs access level 8 (God). Git must already have stored credentials
(git config --global credential.helper store) or 'pull' will stall asking for a login.
